v1.1.1
- solve the issue that GUI becomes abnormal when both WiFi and Wired networks are available

v1.1.0
- add android phone monitor feature, including
  (1) daily record phone battery health, cycle, temperature, etc.
  (2) heat alert
  (3) set battery protect level (charge limit)
- zone feature support router MAC address
- solve the issue of race condition between daemon and GUI that trigger password prompt
- solve the issue that clamshell mode make Amphetamine or similar tools become ineffective
- solve the issue that LED color is sometimes incorrect in LIMIT mode

v1.0.10
- fix the issue that upper-right part of dashboard is not right aligned in some older macOS
- fix the issue that display no longer sleep if clamshell mode is changed to 0 during discharge
- fix the issue that menubar icon color is not changed when charge power source is not Magsafe

v1.0.9
- solve the issue of double App icons in Docker
- solve the issue that update notification is not solved by some users
- change sidebar icon color to be dark mode friendly

v1.0.8
- improve CPU usage efficient to reduce power consumption
- solve memory leak issue caused by menubar popup window
- improve compatibility for users with customized group ID

v1.0.7
This update is critical. Please don't skip
- solve the issue that 'battopt calibrate' process not terminated if execution is interrupted
- shrink docker icon to be consistent with the other Apps
- show health/temperature/power in menubar popup window
- add 'Charge to 100%' and 'Calibration Now' buttons in menubar popup window
- add battery settings modifiction reminder when users first install BattOpt
- modify menubar icons of calibration

v1.0.6
This update is critical. Please don't skip.
- kill zombie processes generated in previous updates
- Change menubar icon which reflect megasafe LED color

v1.0.5
- replace Zone Picker with Zone Toolbar to switch zones for layout consistency
- simplify limit toggle and button name for intuitive usage

v1.0.4
- avoid using black text considering some users prefer dark theme
- move Zone to sidebar and rename to Limiter for more intuitive and convenient usage
- reorder sidebar and set Limiter as default
