v1.0.1
- Fix the issue that WiFi SSID is not detected
- Fix the issue that Start at Login is shown as false when user has already allowed in system settings

v1.0.0
BattOpt first formal release. Main features include
- High Efficiency
- Login-free & Bootcamp Support
- Event-Trigger Framework
- GUI & CLI Interfaces
- Broad Compatibility
- Clamshell Mode Support
- Zone Awareness
- Heat Protection
